                  "text": "19:1-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yehova yero ni Yocuwa, ewacu kumae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yer ni nyithindho mir Israel, wac kumae, Wuwodh adhura mi ringo, m’ayero pire iwu ku dhu Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kara janek m’unego ng’atu moko aka ngo m’eng’eyo de ngo ecopo ringo keca: man gibibedo iwu ni kapiei ni jaculkwoj rimo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ebiringo bang’ adhura acel ma kind maeno, man ebicungo i kamondo mi dhugang’ mir adhurane, man ebiyero lembe pare i ith judongo mir adhura maeno; e gibijole i adhura i bang’gi, man gibimio ire kakare, kara ebed i kindgi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man tek jaculkwoj rimo lubo toke, e gibimio janek i cinge ngo; kum egoyo wadi m’eng’eyo ngo, man nwang’u edage ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ebibedo i adhura maeno, maram ebicungo ko i wang’ cokri mi lembapoka, maram tho pa jalam ma dit ma bibedo nuti i ceng’ maeca biwok ko: e janek bilund dok, man ebicidho bang’ adhura pare ma dhe, man ba ot pare ma dhe, bang’ adhura m’eringo kud i ie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man gikoyo Kedec i Galilaya i ng’om gudi pa Naftali, man Cekem ku ng’om gudi pa Efraim, man Kiriath-arba (ma en e Hebron) i ng’om gudi pa Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man loka kulo Yordan ba Yeriko yo nyangu, gikoyo Bezer i yamba i pambu mi suru pa Ruben, man Ramoth i Gilead kud i suru pa Gad, man Golan i Bacan i suru pa Manase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maeni en e adhura ma jung’olo ni nyithindho mir Israel ceke, man ni jawirok m’ubedo ni umondo i kindgi, kara ng’atu ma tek unego ng’atu moko aka ngo ecopo ringo keca, man kud etho ku cing’ jaculkwoj rimo, ma fodi k’ecungo i wang’ cokri ngo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
